WEBVTT

00:36:57.042 --> 00:37:00.708
This may be a once-in-a-generation
moment to do that.

00:37:02.208 --> 00:37:05.934
And so to actually believe that protest,
including violent protest,

00:37:05.958 --> 00:37:08.226
actually is the way right now.

00:37:08.250 --> 00:37:11.458
What would you say
to someone who felt that?

00:37:14.042 --> 00:37:16.809
BK: First, I just wanted to make
just a slight correction,

00:37:16.833 --> 00:37:19.976
he said riots are the language
of the unheard.

00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:21.976
CA: I apologize, I apologize.

00:37:22.000 --> 00:37:25.643
But that is the point
even more powerfully, yeah.

00:37:25.667 --> 00:37:26.917
BK: Yes.

00:37:27.958 --> 00:37:29.226
Protest we must,

00:37:29.250 --> 00:37:31.934
and we must continue to always protest,